      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 20,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "remember all your offerings, and accept your burned sacrifice. Selah.",
      "ko": "네 모든 소제를 기억하시며 네 번제를 받으시기를 원하노라(셀라)",
      "source_text_hash": "2be290fe6d017878e8b2033c2287c1c7110d48447c13b2f92ff1410b5c57c228",
      "translation_text_hash": "96cdd345eccb6395e1e06a20eb84f64f936514efa8ed52762daecd10f9835b9e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네 모든 소제를 기억하시며 네 번제를 받으시기를 원하노라(셀라)"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "96cdd345eccb6395e1e06a20eb84f64f936514efa8ed52762daecd10f9835b9e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:20:4",
      "sequence": 14187,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 20",
      "verse_label": "4",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
